        {
            "title": "財律指揮｜港股仍在尋底 高派息防守為先 建行較穩陣｜曲鳴",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3173abcf6075a13e06dbea08cacf08cb9271bd52135a0550c38b1fb964a96291/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fzh-tw%2Fbossmind_356%2F8e282788ddcc92d7cdd87f89541f0f18.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">港股近兩周跌勢加快，恒指失守23000點，上周五收約22400點，科網業績亦救不了大市。這個位置再去博反彈，容易接火棒；要留在場內，先要找防守力較強的股份。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">不過，不是所有股份都跟隨大市急挫。建行近月幾乎走平，大市由11月初高位回落接近一成之際，股價仍守在10.5元附近，抗跌力明顯。高派息是原因之一：中期息每股人民幣0.201元，派息率由30%提升至31%，下月3日除淨，即使大市再調整，息收仍在，較博一輪反彈來得實際。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-ce673040-f6c0-3080-9db2-d7f8c7aa6b23-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">公司質地亦撐得住。第三季股東應佔溢利按年升近10%，淨利息收益率企穩於1.36厘，不良貸款率1.29%，較去年底再低。不是純靠炒預期，是有盈利、有息收的內銀龍頭，加上政府亦需要內銀回饋資金，派息未來料不會降低。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">中國已經陸續著手救市，如果國家隊入市，估計也會優先入穩陣的指數ETF〝，而在ETF成份股中，有國家背景的內銀股，佔比較高，自然是較佳選擇。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">建行現價約10.48元，仍企穩20天線約10.4元之上。可於現水平約10.5元買入，目標先看11.3元，失守10元止蝕。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E8%B2%A1%E5%BE%8B%E6%8C%87%E6%8F%AE-%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1%E4%BB%8D%E5%9C%A8%E5%B0%8B%E5%BA%95-%E9%AB%98%E6%B4%BE%E6%81%AF%E9%98%B2%E5%AE%88%E7%82%BA%E5%85%88-%E5%BB%BA%E8%A1%8C%E8%BC%83%E7%A9%A9%E9%99%A3-%E6%9B%B2%E9%B3%B4-020000139.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 10:02:50",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "國際｜金正恩稱朝鮮無意稱霸擴張 強調以實力保障安全",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"國際｜金正恩稱朝鮮無意稱霸擴張 強調以實力保障安全\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">國際｜金正恩稱朝鮮無意稱霸擴張 強調以實力保障安全</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">朝鮮領袖金正恩表示，當前國際形勢與東亞政治軍事環境複雜多變，朝鮮必須具備足以保障安全與和平的實力，但強調平壤不追求霸權與擴張，並指和平、發展與繁榮是對外政策的核心價值。他是在接受十國新任駐朝大使遞交國書後作出上述表態。韓聯社指出，由最高領導人親自接收國書情況罕見，認為平壤有意凸顯領袖在外交事務中的核心地位。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E5%9C%8B%E9%9A%9B-%E9%87%91%E6%AD%A3%E6%81%A9%E7%A8%B1%E6%9C%9D%E9%AE%AE%E7%84%A1%E6%84%8F%E7%A8%B1%E9%9C%B8%E6%93%B4%E5%BC%B5-%E5%BC%B7%E8%AA%BF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%A6%E5%8A%9B%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%9C%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8-010053005.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 09:08:37",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "曹老闆IG｜當成交價遠低於估價 商業物業「真價值」喺邊度？",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"628\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9b23d6ac9124c12f640e4dbadea84398122f08c65ea09f9128da9265e62863e6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fbossmind_356%2F7abbc4bb328d0607f9204334464b5e31.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">近排商業樓市真係吹住淡風，交易一個接一個「割肉」，折扣深到連老江湖都有點心驚。令人不禁問，商業物業估價，是否真係反映咗物業價值？</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">市建局喺土瓜灣道嗰個項目，市場本來估約40億至45億元，結果信置夥鷹君只出26.88億，呎價約5,068元，較估值低三成。領展賣旺角T.O.P，23億成交，較9月底估值約25.17億已經折讓8.6%，對比2016年入貨價59.1億，更係蒸發咗超過六成。內房綠景中國2017年90億買入嘅觀塘綠景NEO，而家銀主盤得27億轉手，之前估價都仲有45至50億。紅磡海名軒基座嗰三層巨舖，估值5.5億至5.8億，最終只得3.23億，較估值低約四成，對比高峰11.6億，跌幅更深達72%。大角咀One Bedford Place估15億，結果於6月底以約7.48億易手，半價都冇。連深水埗「愛海頌」商場交吉賣出，扣除車位後實質呎價不足3,000元，業界即刻嗡嗡聲。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-805a101c-d764-3e13-bfe3-9f50509611bb-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">呢啲數字擺出嚟，已經唔係「有折」咁簡單，係直接反映而家商業物業嘅實際成交價，同估值之間出現明顯落差。問題嚟喇：估價係咪已經偏低？定係市場根本就係咁殘？</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">講真，而家銀行對商業樓宇按揭真係好收緊。利率高企、空置率上升、零售同寫字樓需求轉弱，銀行寧願少做甚至拒做。結果就係有啲業主或者銀主盤，被迫用「急賣價」出貨，成交價自然再低過估值一截。估值本身已經因為近期成交稀少、比較案例少，傾向保守；再加埋實際交易往往帶「被迫」成分，兩個數字疊加，就變成而家見到嘅「估價低、成交更低」。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">但係，估價低唔等於物業「真價值」就係咁。估值係根據當下市場可觀察交易、租金回報、折現率去計，短期情緒同流動性會嚴重影響。而家商業物業面對嘅係結構性調整，例如在家工作改變寫字樓需求、網購衝擊傳統零售、利息成本高企，所以市場暫時的定價，同物業長期租金潛力、位置優勢、改建可能性，未必完全匹配。海名軒嗰批舖，簽咗國際名校長約之後先有人肯埋單，已經說明「有穩定現金流」同「冇租約空置」之間，差價可以好大。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">當然，亦唔可以太樂觀。近期呢啲大折讓交易，已經成為新嘅比較案例，估價師下一次估值時，好難完全無視。銀行會更加審慎，業主融資更難，形成惡性循環。商業樓市短期內仍然會喺「估值偏低、成交再折」嘅區間徘徊。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">所以，商業物業估價而家係咪如實反映價值？答案係：反映咗而家「可以成交」嘅價值；真正嘅價值，要等利率、需求同資金重新平衡之後，先會慢慢浮現。投資者而家最緊要嘅，唔係問估價準唔準，而係問自己：呢個價錢，係咪已經消化咗足夠悲觀情緒？如果答案係肯定，先至值得落注。否則，繼續觀望，等真正嘅底部出現，可能更加穩陣。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">曹老闆<br/>註：專欄作家言論不代表本網立場</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%9B%B9%E8%80%81%E9%97%86ig-%E7%95%B6%E6%88%90%E4%BA%A4%E5%83%B9%E9%81%A0%E4%BD%8E%E6%96%BC%E4%BC%B0%E5%83%B9-%E5%95%86%E6%A5%AD%E7%89%A9%E6%A5%AD-%E7%9C%9F%E5%83%B9%E5%80%BC-%E5%96%BA%E9%82%8A%E5%BA%A6-010000499.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-23 09:05:12",
